{"4292740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tome Improvement", "steam_appid": 4292740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A co-op dungeon crawler where you and your friends name the spells. Catch critters, combine them in your staff, and hope your friends remember which spell is &quot;DIVORCE BEAM&quot; when you are surrounded by skeletons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft Your Own Magic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget &quot;Fireball&quot; and &quot;Ice Blast.&quot; In Tome Improvement, spells are whatever you name them. Combine critters to create 34 unique spell effects, from devastating attacks to  buffs and healing zones. Just hope your friends remember which is which.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Coordinate (Or Don't)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat lets you yell spell names across the dungeon. Just remember, friendly fire is always on. That explosive area spell might hit the skeletons, or it might launch your teammate to their death. Choose wisely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-8 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >34 spell combinations to discover and name</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat for yelling spell names across the dungeon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendly fire </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full gamepad support </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A co-op dungeon crawler where you and your friends name the spells. Catch critters, combine them in your staff, and hope your friends remember which spell is &quot;DIVORCE BEAM&quot; when you are surrounded by skeletons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft Your Own Magic</h2><p class=\"bb_para